---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <div class='flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-2 sm:gap-10'>
    <div class='block sm:hidden'>
      <h1 class='text-6xl text-center'>Amiel Christian Mala-ay</h1>
      <h2 class='text-4xl font-[Junicode] text-center'>
        <span class='text-[var(--blue-1)]'>/ˈeɪ.miəl/</span>, alt. <span
          class='text-[var(--blue-1)]'>/a.mjɛl/</span
        >
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div id="images"
      class='mx-auto gap-1
            grid sm:flex sm:flex-col lg:grid
            grid-cols-[repeat(5,14vw)] grid-rows-[repeat(8,14vw)]
            lg:grid-cols-[repeat(5,7vw)] lg:grid-rows-[repeat(8,7vw)]
            xl:grid-cols-[repeat(5,5vw)] xl:grid-rows-[repeat(8,5vw)]'
    >
      <div
        class='border-1 border-gray grayscale hover:grayscale-0 duration-200
        rounded-tl-md sm:rounded-tl-none lg:rounded-tl-md
        col-span-3 row-span-4 overflow-clip'
      >
        <img
          src='./pictures/pic-1.jpeg'
          class='object-cover w-[100%] h-[100%]'
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class='border-1 border-gray grayscale hover:grayscale-0 duration-200
        rounded-tr-md sm:rounded-tr-none lg:rounded-tr-md
        col-span-2 row-span-3 overflow-clip'
      >
        <img
          src='./pictures/pic-2.jpeg'
          class='object-cover w-[100%] h-[100%]'
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class='border-1 border-gray grayscale hover:grayscale-0 duration-200
        col-span-2 row-span-2 overflow-clip'
      >
        <img
          src='./pictures/pic-3.jpeg'
          class='object-cover w-[100%] h-[100%]'
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class='border-1 border-gray grayscale hover:grayscale-0 duration-200
        rounded-bl-md sm:rounded-bl-none lg:rounded-bl-md
        col-span-3 row-span-4 overflow-clip'
      >
        <img
          src='./pictures/pic-4.jpg'
          class='object-cover w-[100%] h-[100%]'
        />
      </div>
      <div
        class='border-1 border-gray grayscale hover:grayscale-0 duration-200
        rounded-br-md sm:rounded-br-none lg:rounded-br-md
        col-span-2 row-span-3 overflow-clip'
      >
        <img
          src='./pictures/pic-5.jpeg'
          class='object-cover w-[100%] h-[100%]'
        />
      </div>
    </div>
    <section class='mb-[5%]'>
      <div class='hidden sm:block'>
        <h1 class='text-6xl'>Amiel Christian Mala-ay</h1>
        <h2 class='text-4xl font-[Junicode]'>
          <span class='text-[var(--blue-1)]'>/ˈeɪ.miəl/</span>, alt. <span
            class='text-[var(--blue-1)]'>/a.mjɛl/</span
          >
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class='mt-[1rem]'>
        My name is Amiel Christian Mala-ay, a software engineer based in Manila,
        specializing in full-stack web development and machine learning,
        particularly computer vision.
      </div>
      <div class='mt-[1rem]'>
        From an early age, I have had a passion for technology and software, and
        I have always enjoyed building things, solving problems, and most
        importantly, learning new things. This led me to pursue a degree in
        Computer Science at the University of Santo Tomas, where I developed a
        solid foundation in full-stack web development and machine learning. I
        have also had the opportunity to work on a variety of projects that have
        allowed me to apply my knowledge and create impactful solutions to
        real-world projects.
      </div>
      <div class='mt-[1rem]'>
        This website serves as a portfolio of my work, showcasing my skills and
        projects. I hope you enjoy exploring it as much as I enjoyed creating
        it! Please feel free to <a
          href='/contact'
          class='text-[var(--blue-2)] dark:text-[var(--blue-2-dark)] underline'
          >reach out</a
        > if you have any questions or would like to collaborate with me.
      </div>
      <!-- <div>
    Outside of technology, I have a passion for history — I enjoy reading about
    how our world and its different cultures have been shaped by the past. I also enjoy
    reading and writing essays, particularly on topics related to technology and
    its impact on society.
  </div> -->
      <div class='mt-[1rem]'>
        You can also take a look at my CV <a
          href='./Mala-ay - CV.pdf'
          class='text-[var(--blue-2)] dark:text-[var(--blue-2-dark)] underline'
          >here.</a
        >
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
